  "entry": "code/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A guided Chinese-language dashboard for setting a study area and two or more time periods, then running background jobs on Sentinel-2/Landsat imagery: spectral-index change detection, land-cover classification and multi-year trend analysis. Each job is tracked in a task center and its results are archived in a results library. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
